  "world": {
    "id": "call-wild-world",
    "name": "The Call of the Wild",
    "description": "Jack London’s Northland novel follows Buck from a sheltered California estate into the Klondike dog trade, where work, violence, leadership, hunger, human devotion, and the recurring voice of the forest reshape him. The sled trail tests every bond until Buck must choose what remains after the last campfire goes dark.",
